    },
    "Defeat is not the worst of failures. Not to have tried is the true failure." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Eine Niederlage ist nicht das schlimmste Scheitern. Es nicht versucht zu haben, ist das wahre Scheitern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not let what you cannot do interfere with what you can do." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lass nicht zu, dass das, was du nicht kannst, dem im Weg steht, was du kannst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do today what others won't and achieve tomorrow what others can't." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tu heute, was andere nicht tun, und erreiche morgen, was andere nicht erreichen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't let the fear of losing be greater than the excitement of winning." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lass die Angst vor dem Verlieren nicht größer sein als die Freude am Gewinnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't wait for the opportunities to come. Get up and create them." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Warte nicht auf Gelegenheiten. Steh auf und schaff sie dir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't wait. The time will never be just right." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Warte nicht. Der richtige Zeitpunkt kommt nie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't worry about failure; you only have to succeed once." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mach dir keine Sorgen ums Scheitern – du musst nur einmal Erfolg haben."
