          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every \"no\" gets you one step closer to \"yes.\"" : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jedes „Nein“ bringt dich einen Schritt näher an ein „Ja“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every approach is practice for the one that works." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jedes Ansprechen ist Übung für das eine, das klappt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every master was once a beginner who refused to quit." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jeder Meister war einmal ein Anfänger, der nicht aufgegeben hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every successful person has faced rejection. The difference is they didn't let it stop them from trying again." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jeder erfolgreiche Mensch wurde schon zurückgewiesen. Der Unterschied: Er hat sich davon nicht abhalten lassen, es wieder zu versuchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every time" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
