        }
      }
    },
    "If there is no struggle, there is no progress." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ohne Kampf kein Fortschritt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you are not willing to risk the unusual, you will have to settle for the ordinary." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer das Ungewöhnliche nicht wagt, muss sich mit dem Gewöhnlichen zufriedengeben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don't try, you'll never know what could of been." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn du es nicht versuchst, wirst du nie wissen, was hätte sein können."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don’t like something, change it. If you can’t change it, change your attitude." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn dir etwas nicht gefällt, ändere es. Wenn du es nicht ändern kannst, ändere deine Einstellung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don’t risk anything, you risk everything." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer nichts riskiert, riskiert alles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don’t swing you’ll never hit a home run." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer nicht schießt, kann kein Tor schießen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you face towards the sunshine, you’ll notice the shadows will fall behind you." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn du dich der Sonne zuwendest, fallen die Schatten hinter dich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you wait to feel ready, you will wait forever." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn du wartest, bis du dich bereit fühlst, wartest du ewig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In order to succeed, your desire for success should be greater than your fear of failure." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Um erfolgreich zu sein, muss dein Wunsch nach Erfolg größer sein als deine Angst vor dem Scheitern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inaction guarantees nothing happens. Action is the only path that creates possibility." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nichtstun garantiert, dass nichts passiert. Nur Handeln schafft Möglichkeiten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inner Stability" : {
      "comment" : "Course title.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Innere Stabilität"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It always seems impossible until it’s done." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Es scheint immer unmöglich, bis es getan ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It does not matter how slowly you go as long as you do not stop." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Es ist egal, wie langsam du gehst, solange du nicht stehen bleibst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is necessary to put yourself out for rejection and accept that you will be rejected." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Man muss sich der Zurückweisung aussetzen und akzeptieren, dass man zurückgewiesen wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's not because things are difficult that we dare not venture. It's because we dare not venture that they are difficult." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nicht weil es schwer ist, wagen wir es nicht, sondern weil wir es nicht wagen, ist es schwer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s better to know and be disappointed than to never know and always wonder." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lieber wissen und enttäuscht sein, als nie wissen und sich immer fragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping conversations going" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Gespräche am Laufen halten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leap before you're ready; growth happens in mid-air." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Spring, bevor du bereit bist – gewachsen wird in der Luft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learning & Self Discovery" : {
      "comment" : "Course title.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lernen & Selbsterkenntnis"
