        }
      }
    },
    "Learning how to approach" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lernen, wie man jemanden anspricht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Life is not about living the safer option. Life is about living a life worth living." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Im Leben geht es nicht um die sichere Option. Es geht darum, ein Leben zu führen, das sich lohnt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Life shrinks or expands in proportion to one's courage." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
