          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No approach is wasted; it either works or reveals what to change." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Kein Ansprechen ist verschwendet: Entweder es klappt, oder du siehst, was du ändern musst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No one can make you feel inferior without your consent." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Niemand kann dir ohne deine Zustimmung das Gefühl geben, minderwertig zu sein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No, I usually go for it" : {
