    "Small talk & Momentum" : {
      "comment" : "Course title.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Smalltalk & Momentum"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sometimes" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Manchmal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start where you are. Use what you have. Do what you can." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Fang da an, wo du bist. Nutze, was du hast. Tu, was du kannst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success is not final, failure is not fatal: It is the courage to continue that counts." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erfolg ist nicht endgültig, Scheitern ist nicht tödlich: Was zählt, ist der Mut weiterzumachen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success is the sum of small efforts repeated day in and day out." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erfolg ist die Summe kleiner Anstrengungen, Tag für Tag wiederholt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success is walking from failure to failure with no loss of enthusiasm." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erfolg heißt, von Misserfolg zu Misserfolg zu gehen, ohne die Begeisterung zu verlieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Successful people willingly do what unsuccessful people are unwilling to do." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erfolgreiche Menschen tun bereitwillig, was erfolglose nicht tun wollen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swing the bat — home runs don't happen from the bench." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ran an den Ball – von der Ersatzbank aus schießt niemand Tore."
